			{"title": "5. ANALYTICS, ADS AND PERMISSIONS", "body": "This version does not integrate our own advertising SDKs or third-party analytics SDKs. Internet access is used for Lightning payments and, if configured, leaderboard services. The app store, operating system, wallet or payment provider may process information under their own policies, outside ILLU ENTERTAINMENT's control."},
